## 🧰 Three-Step Geotagging Workflow

HoudahGeo organizes the main process into three stages: **Load, Process and Output**.

<div align="left">

### 📥 Load

> 📷 **Add Media:** Import photos and videos into a project.
> 🛰️ **Add GPS Data:** Import available track logs and waypoints.
> 📱 **Reference Media:** Add GPS-enabled reference photos when required.
> ⚙️ **Camera Setup:** Provide camera timing information for accurate matching.

### 🧭 Process

> 🗺️ **Geocode:** Determine where media was captured.
> 🔍 **Verify:** Review assigned locations on the map.
> 📍 **Adjust:** Manually correct inaccurate positions.
> 📝 **Enrich:** Add titles, descriptions, keywords and place information.

### 📤 Output

> 🧩 **Write Metadata:** Export location information to supported media metadata.
> 📄 **Create XMP:** Use sidecar metadata where appropriate.
> 🌎 **Export Maps:** Create KML/KMZ and other supported geographic exports.
> 📊 **Share Data:** Prepare location information for compatible mapping and publishing workflows.

</div>

